  "full_response": "**Table of Contents:** \n\n* [Introduction](#introduction)\n* [Understanding Credentials](#understanding-credentials)\n* [Production Access Credentials](#production-access-credentials)\n\n---\n\n**# Introduction**\n\nAccessing and managing services in a production environment requires a strategic approach to security. This page documents the Production Access Credentials, which should only be accessed by authorized personnel. For other environments like development and testing, please refer to the relevant sections. Remember: Keep your access credentials confidential and following security practices is mandatory.\n\n\n\n**# Understanding Credentials**\n\nBefore we discuss production credentials, it's important to understand why they matter. Access credentials – usernames, passwords, API keys, etc. – grant permissions and access to underlying systems and resources.\n\nHere, you'll find an organized directory into microservices, necessitating authorization prior to event access being granted.\n\n- Service URLs: Keeping a record of service endpoints (/web, /api, etc.) facilitates graceful communication.\n\n- Usernames/Passwords/API Keys: Secure credentials are stored and utilized on a case-by-case basis. A foolproof, secure gateway, typically treated through encrypted files, that permits access to such passwords and keys, is recommended.\n\n\n**# Production Access Credentials**\n\nThis table lists the production access credentials, including service names, URLs, usernames, passwords, API keys.\n\n*Please note: The credentials provided in this list are entirely fictitious and have been created solely for illustrative purposes.*\n\n| Service Name | URL | Username | Password/API key |\n|--------------|-----|----------|------------------|\n| Authentication Service | https://auth.microservice.com | John_Doe | 1234567890abcdef |\n| User Profile | https://api.mymicroservice.com/profile | Jane_Smith | yZ789XcVbUaTQtW5G2bXGwmxEGjN0qJP |\n| Payment Gateway | https://pay.ourservice.com | Michael_Sm | $2a8b9f1c8d8efb3ad913ca0487227f97 |\n| Product Inventory | https://upmymicroservice.com/inventory | Emily_Wang | H45B6C7890dE57aF8EE5b6C6aF2cC4a7eVwb |\n| Order Management | https://order.mymicroservice.com | Ali_B | 3d3n3E3b5F97bE09C6f026d19436c23a |\n| Customer Support",
